msgid "DJI RS2 and RS3-Pro Gimbals"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-djirs2-gimbal.rst:12
#: e1dad2513b6344a4a08c0e274ed83067
msgid "ArduPilot 4.4 (and higher) support the `DJI RS2 <https://www.dji.com/rs-2>`__ and `DJI RS3-Pro <https://www.dji.com/jp/rs-3-pro>`__ handheld gimbals using a :ref:`Lua script <common-lua-scripts>`.  The driver relies on the gimbal supporting the \"DJI R SDK\" protocol which is only these two gimbals as far as we know.  Other gimbals including the very similar RSC2 and RS3 are not supported."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-djirs2-gimbal.rst:14
#: c23002ff80ad4788806d4a07a4276bb7
